    "detailed_description": "Immerse yourself in the harsh realities of the wilderness with TRAPPER, a 2D pixel art adventure / strategy game that challenges your survival instincts. <br><br>As a lone survivor, you must navigate through a world where every decision counts. Master the essential skills of scavenging, crafting, fishing, hunting, and cooking in order to stay alive.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751970/extras/01fb3b7945ff241137c95c8d42e61c8b.poster.avif?t=1726066503\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751970/extras/01fb3b7945ff241137c95c8d42e61c8b.apng?t=1726066503\" class=\"bb_img\" width=181 height=34 /></picture></span><br>Explore a variety of environments to find crucial resources. From abandoned ruins to dense forests, every location offers unique items that can aid your survival.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751970/extras/d2136c1d59ccbcbb3dc0a2ebb13a094d.poster.avif?t=1726066503\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751970/extras/d2136c1d59ccbcbb3dc0a2ebb13a094d.apng?t=1726066503\" class=\"bb_img\" width=181 height=34 /></picture></span><br>Use the materials you gather to create tools, weapons, and shelters. Crafting is essential for protection and survival in the wild.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751970/extras/53ad03d37e4dfd8e36fa568f6d0cf6b2.poster.avif?t=1726066503\" width=181 height=34 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751970/extras/53ad03d37e4dfd8e36fa568f6d0cf6b2.webm?t=1726066503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Enjoy the tranquility of fishing in lakes and rivers. Fishing provides a reliable food source and a moment of peace in a dangerous world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751970/extras/c6550162f65f9c8f0655256d994f52bb.poster.avif?t=1726066503\" width=181 height=34 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751970/extras/c6550162f65f9c8f0655256d994f52bb.webm?t=1726066503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Track and hunt wildlife to secure food and materials. Use your crafted weapons and traps to ensure a successful hunt.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751970/extras/a0ee5cab0391854a9f566ebcb4986143.poster.avif?t=1726066503\" width=181 height=34 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751970/extras/a0ee5cab0391854a9f566ebcb4986143.webm?t=1726066503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Combine your gathered ingredients to cook meals that restore health and energy. Cooking is vital for maintaining your strength and well-being.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751970/extras/56458c277696c22e89d4ee4d38ad3220.poster.avif?t=1726066503\" width=181 height=34 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751970/extras/56458c277696c22e89d4ee4d38ad3220.webm?t=1726066503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Engage in strategic turn-based battles with wild animals and other threats. Plan your moves carefully to survive each encounter.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751970/extras/f6545d0fd478c95f36ec9166a6729137.poster.avif?t=1726066503\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751970/extras/f6545d0fd478c95f36ec9166a6729137.apng?t=1726066503\" class=\"bb_img\" width=181 height=34 /></picture></span><br>Manage your supplies and stats wisely. Always be prepared for unexpected challenges. Running out of resources can lead to dire consequences.<br><br>In TRAPPER, the wilderness is unforgiving, and being unprepared can have dramatic consequences. Are you ready to test your survival skills and face the challenges of the wild? Embark on this thrilling adventure and prove your mettle!",
    "about_the_game": "Immerse yourself in the harsh realities of the wilderness with TRAPPER, a 2D pixel art adventure / strategy game that challenges your survival instincts. <br><br>As a lone survivor, you must navigate through a world where every decision counts. Master the essential skills of scavenging, crafting, fishing, hunting, and cooking in order to stay alive.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751970/extras/01fb3b7945ff241137c95c8d42e61c8b.poster.avif?t=1726066503\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751970/extras/01fb3b7945ff241137c95c8d42e61c8b.apng?t=1726066503\" class=\"bb_img\" width=181 height=34 /></picture></span><br>Explore a variety of environments to find crucial resources. From abandoned ruins to dense forests, every location offers unique items that can aid your survival.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751970/extras/d2136c1d59ccbcbb3dc0a2ebb13a094d.poster.avif?t=1726066503\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751970/extras/d2136c1d59ccbcbb3dc0a2ebb13a094d.apng?t=1726066503\" class=\"bb_img\" width=181 height=34 /></picture></span><br>Use the materials you gather to create tools, weapons, and shelters. Crafting is essential for protection and survival in the wild.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751970/extras/53ad03d37e4dfd8e36fa568f6d0cf6b2.poster.avif?t=1726066503\" width=181 height=34 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751970/extras/53ad03d37e4dfd8e36fa568f6d0cf6b2.webm?t=1726066503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Enjoy the tranquility of fishing in lakes and rivers. Fishing provides a reliable food source and a moment of peace in a dangerous world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751970/extras/c6550162f65f9c8f0655256d994f52bb.poster.avif?t=1726066503\" width=181 height=34 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751970/extras/c6550162f65f9c8f0655256d994f52bb.webm?t=1726066503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Track and hunt wildlife to secure food and materials. Use your crafted weapons and traps to ensure a successful hunt.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751970/extras/a0ee5cab0391854a9f566ebcb4986143.poster.avif?t=1726066503\" width=181 height=34 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751970/extras/a0ee5cab0391854a9f566ebcb4986143.webm?t=1726066503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Combine your gathered ingredients to cook meals that restore health and energy. Cooking is vital for maintaining your strength and well-being.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751970/extras/56458c277696c22e89d4ee4d38ad3220.poster.avif?t=1726066503\" width=181 height=34 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751970/extras/56458c277696c22e89d4ee4d38ad3220.webm?t=1726066503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Engage in strategic turn-based battles with wild animals and other threats. Plan your moves carefully to survive each encounter.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751970/extras/f6545d0fd478c95f36ec9166a6729137.poster.avif?t=1726066503\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751970/extras/f6545d0fd478c95f36ec9166a6729137.apng?t=1726066503\" class=\"bb_img\" width=181 height=34 /></picture></span><br>Manage your supplies and stats wisely. Always be prepared for unexpected challenges. Running out of resources can lead to dire consequences.<br><br>In TRAPPER, the wilderness is unforgiving, and being unprepared can have dramatic consequences. Are you ready to test your survival skills and face the challenges of the wild? Embark on this thrilling adventure and prove your mettle!",
